./odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:21247:The office:conversion-mode attribute specifies the method by which the DDE server converts its data into numbers. 
./odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:21249:The defined values for the office:conversion-mode attribute are:
