./odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:21261:The values of the office:conversion-mode attribute are into-default-style-data-style, into-english-number or keep-text.
./odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:21317:19.379 office:mimetype
./odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:21319:The office:mimetype attribute specifies the document type for a document that is contained in a single XML file. Its values are the MIME types that are used for the packaged variant of office documents.
./odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:21321:The office:mimetype attribute is usable with the following element: <office:document> 3.1.2.
