./odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:36609:The defined values for the draw:color-inversion attribute are:
./odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:36615:The draw:color-inversion attribute is usable with the following element: <style:graphic-properties> 17.21.
./odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:36617:The draw:color-inversion attribute has the data type boolean 18.3.3.
./odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:39205:If the attribute value is not from-left and not from-inside, the svg:x attribute associated with the frame element is ignored for text documents.
